# Local tooling
.claude/
# Keeps the machine awake during long unattended runs -- a personal hack, and
# the test suite takes minutes, so it earns its place locally without being
# something the repo should carry.
.claudenosleep.ps1

# Throwaway measurement harnesses. M4 used a lot of these -- headless copies
# of the frame loop, run at app scale to settle a question and then deleted.
# They are diagnostics, not suites, and they must not reach the repo.
*probe*.mjs
